            package: Dil(14),
            datasheet: "Dual D flip-flop (DIL-14)\n\nTwo independent rising-edge D flip-flops. PRE and CLR are asynchronous and active high (unlike many real parts); leave them at 0 for normal use.\n\nPins: 1 1CLR, 2 1D, 3 1CLK, 4 1PRE, 5 1Q, 6 1QN, 7 GND (not modelled), 8 2QN, 9 2Q, 10 2PRE, 11 2CLK, 12 2D, 13 2CLR, 14 VCC (not modelled).",
